Find Kth Rotation
Given an increasing sorted rotated array arr[] of distinct integers. The array is right-rotated k times. Find the value of k.
Let's suppose we have an array arr[] = [2, 4, 6, 9], if we rotate it by 2 times it will look like this:
After 1st Rotation : [9, 2, 4, 6]
After 2nd Rotation : [6, 9, 2, 4]

Explanation:

FInd the minimum element in the sorted array and then its index is the number of times it was rotated.

Code:

class Solution {
    public int findKRotation(int arr[]) {
        // Code here
        int n=arr.length;
        int min=arr[0]; int min_idx=0;
        int left=0; int right=n-1;
        
        while(left<=right){
            
            int mid=(left+right)/2;
            
            if(arr[left]<=arr[mid]){
                if(arr[left]<min){
                    min=arr[left];
                    min_idx= left;
                }
                left=mid+1;
            }
            else{
                if(arr[mid]<min){
                    min=arr[mid];
                    min_idx=mid;
                }
                right=mid-1;
            }

        }
        
        return min_idx;
    }
}
